    "name": "Genome annotation with Maker (short) (update)",
    "readme": "This workflow is used for the GTN \u201cGenome annotation with Maker (short)\u201d (https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/genome-annotation/tutorials/annotation-with-maker-short/tutorial.html).\n\n\nMaker is a tool for annotating genomic sequences. In this tutorial, you will learn how to annotate a genome and assess its quality..",
